       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Sertraline 1000 mg is five times the maximum recommended adult dose of 200 mg/day. A dose that high risks serotonin syndrome, seizures, QT prolongation, and severe GI or bleeding effects.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **100 mg** by mouth once daily. This is a common maintenance dose.\n- **50 mg** by mouth once daily. This is the usual starting dose for depression or anxiety.\n- **25 mg** by mouth once daily. This is the usual starting dose for panic disorder or PTSD, or for patients who are sensitive to side effects.\n\nTell me the dose you want, or confirm that 1000 mg is intended. If it is, tell me the clinical reason and I'll add it to the order note. I'll enter the order once I have that."
